\f0\fs24 \cf0 # IBIT Bitcoin Volatility Harvesting & Cash Yield Engine\
\
Production alert-only quantitative system harvesting daily Spot `BTC/USD` volatility via **IBIT** using fixed non-compounding tranches ($25k / $50k) and independent lot accounting (ANY rule).\
\
## 1. Strategy Rules Summary\
\
| Rule | Condition | Action |\
| :--- | :--- | :--- |\
| **Timeframe** | `BTCUSD` Daily (`1D`) close at `00:00 UTC` | Evaluates strictly once per daily bar close |\
| **Tier 1 Entry** | `-2.50% >= Daily Return > -4.50%` | Buy **$25,000** of `IBIT` |\
| **Tier 2 Entry** | `Daily Return <= -4.50%` | Buy **$50,000** of `IBIT` |\
| **Momentum Exit** | `Daily BTC Return >= +2.10%` AND `Current Price > Tranche Entry Price` | Sell ALL profitable tranches simultaneously; keep profit in cash |\
\
## 2. TradingView Setup (`tradingview_engine.pine`)\
1. Open **TradingView** -> **`BTCUSD`** -> **`1D`** timeframe.\
2. Open **Pine Editor** -> Paste `tradingview_engine.pine` -> **Save** -> **Add to chart**.\
3. Verify executions in the **Strategy Tester** -> **List of Trades**.\
\
## 3. Google Sheets Webhook Deployment\
1. Open Google Sheet `1_R3lsppGz27bBpzEbRsm1JqB6MFYNniyIw4qKSg5hFk` -> **Extensions** -> **Apps Script**.\
2. Paste `google_sheets_webhook.js` -> **Save**.\
